# ── Never commit ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC. Anything below is either a live credential or a
# build artefact, and a credential committed here is a credential leaked, even
# if the commit is reverted afterwards. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` fails the
# build if any of these ever appear in the tree — belt as well as braces.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.deploy.example
serviceAccountKey.json
.vercel/

# ── Build output and dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.expo/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
